{"pin":"AB06012","subcodes":[{"code":"AB06012","anchor":"","first_line":"O God, my God! Thou seest me, Thou knowest me; Thou art my Haven and My","first_line_orig":"الهی تو بینا و آگاهی که ملجا و پناهی جز تو نجسته و نجویم و بغیر از سبیل محبتت  ","language":"Per","word_count":"130","full_text_parts":["He is the Compassionate, the All-Bountiful!  O God, my God!  Thou seest me, Thou knowest me; Thou art my Haven and my Refuge.  None have I sought nor any will I seek save Thee; no path have I trodden nor any will I tread but the path of Thy love.  In the darksome night of despair, my eye turneth expectant and full of hope to the morn of Thy boundless favor and at the hour of dawn my drooping soul is refreshed and strengthened in remembrance of Thy beauty and perfection.  He whom the grace of Thy mercy aideth, though he be but a drop, shall become the boundless ocean, and the merest atom which the outpouring of Thy loving kindness assisteth, shall shine even as the radiant star.\nShelter under Thy protection, O Thou Spirit of purity, Thou Who art the All-Bountiful Provider, this enthralled, enkindled servant of Thine.  Aid him in this world","of being to remain steadfast and firm in Thy love and grant that this broken-winged bird attain a refuge and shelter in Thy divine nest that abideth upon the celestial tree."],"translations":[{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"sq","lang_name":"Albanian"},{"language":"lv","lang_name":"Latvian"},{"language":"fr","lang_name":"French"},{"language":"sk","lang_name":"Slovak"},{"language":"th","lang_name":"Thai"},{"language":"no","lang_name":"Norwegian"},{"language":"lg","lang_name":"Ganda"},{"language":"sv","lang_name":"Swedish"},{"language":"is","lang_name":"Icelandic"},{"language":"bi","lang_name":"Bislama"},{"language":"ms","lang_name":"Malay"},{"language":"tet","lang_name":"Tetum"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"med","lang_name":"Melpa"},{"language":"k